  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 01 August 2025, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 1 August 2025 and 30 June 2025 and numbered A-02, A-03 and A-04 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clauses E(a) and E.1(e) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the proposed outbuilding includes primary living accommodation in the form of a bathroom and measures more than 2.5 metres high and is within 2 metres of a boundary. \r\n"
